<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35078" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναφίημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>let drop into, put in</i>, in aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπῆκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.214
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναφάπτω</span>);
			<i>insert</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				723b23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>discharge in</i> or <i>into</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					553b24
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ κοίτῃ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόπρον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of land in
			Egypt, <i>release</i>, i.e. <i>transfer to private tenure</i>,
			in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				918xiii 9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>leave</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναφῆκέν μου τὰ κτήματα ἀγεώργητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					5.20
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>permit</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατρέχειν τὸ πνεῦμα ἐν
				αὐτοῖς</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς
				νεύροις</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				37
			</span></i>.</div>
